304
00:16:19,240 --> 00:16:19,640
Oh!

305
00:16:19,940 --> 00:16:21,740
You think you can defeat my magic, huh?

306
00:16:21,880 --> 00:16:22,900
Well, I'll just hit that spell

307
00:16:22,900 --> 00:16:23,780
